# Capacitor native projects.
#
# Regenerated from capacitor.config.ts with `cap add android|ios`, and nothing
# in them is hand-edited: the notification permission is contributed by the
# plugin through manifest merge. Committing 4 MB of generated Gradle and Xcode
# scaffolding that cannot be built or verified on the CI host would be code
# nobody reviews. Run `bun run mobile:sync` after cloning.
/android
/ios
